    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Board A of the Singles Event Companion is a mirror matchup: Priority Assets against Priority Assets, and both players play Sabotage. The app pairs this board with the Sweeping Engagement deployment. Neither disposition fixes the Attacker or Defender role; a roll-off settles that. Every zone, territory, objective and terrain position comes only from the official board image, and this entry states no measurements. Its lettered terrain pieces refer to the parts of the Battlefields: Armageddon kit.",
